# Array elements must share a base type

Verifies an array literal mixing a measure element with a string element is
rejected because the two elements share no base type.

>>> source
let values = [10mm, "hello"]

<<< stdout

<<< stderr
eck: array elements must share a base type; found `int64[mm]` and `string` at Span { start: 13, end: 28 }

<<< exit
1
